From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:55:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Resolve evicted review sources from the board
 replica

Pool pickup carries review history but not terminal creator cards; eviction makes one-off imports transient. Read absent source cards and their run/event evidence from one read-only selected-board replica snapshot. Prefer local source evidence and preserve fail-closed absence, model exclusion, and original provenance. Do not import runnable source cards or mutate policy.

Proof: real continuation and synced pickup import reproduces missing-source refusal before fix. Dispatcher regression verifies independent route, checkpoint and landing edge preservation; missing/unreadable replica, missing remote source, author pin, local precedence and unsynced controls pass.
